## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| exit 4 with "MSA_ENV_MISSING" | `paramiko` not importable | run the printed `pip install` command, or set `MSA_AUTO_INSTALL=1` |
| exit 3 with "ClusterConfigError" | required cluster fields missing | ask the user for this task's cluster coordinates and supply them via inline `HPC_*` env vars on the run command (never reuse a cached file) |
| calc_status=failed, error="ORCA_TERMINATED_ABNORMALLY" | the `.out` lacks the normal-termination sentinel | check the `.inp` parameters and the XYZ geometry |
| calc_status=failed, error="ORCA .out not produced" | the job produced no output file | inspect the `.slurmout` on the cluster; check the SLURM script / ORCA module |
| calc_status=failed, error contains "SLURM poll returned TIMEOUT" | the job exceeded the poll timeout | raise the walltime / poll timeout or check the queue |
| no slurm_job_id | HPC submission failed (network / auth) | check the cluster profile (host / user / password or key_file) and network / VPN |
| task passed through with no calc_status | `target_spectra != "{{SPEC}}"` | expected — another orca-{spec} skill owns that task |
